      "text": "Because \\(a\\gt0,\\) the equation \\(f(y)=ay^2-\\sqrt2=-\\sqrt2\\) forces \\(y=0.\\) Hence \\[ f(\\sqrt2)=2a-\\sqrt2=0, \\] so \\(a=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}.\\)\n\nThus the correct answer is D.",
